\n但您也可以选择其他较低的值。\n只需确保它们保持与您在前面步骤中计算的纵横比相同。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 205.13563537597656], "pos": [1115.9266357421875, -348.61474609375], "id": 196, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [217], "label": "INT", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "整数"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [720, "fixed"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "数值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveInt", "title": "Height", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [210, 82], "pos": [870.7898559570312, -353.2938537597656], "id": 139, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.38", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveInt"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [215], "label": "INT", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "整数"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [1280, "fixed"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "数值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveInt", "title": "Width", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [210, 82], "pos": [873.6636352539062, -223.36622619628906], "id": 137, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.38", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveInt"}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["输入目标视频的帧长度（+1）\n因此，1秒30帧的视频将是31帧，2秒将是61帧。\n如果你不知道确切的长度，你可以猜测。\n最大长度取决于GPU的VRAM。\n您可以输入比源视频更长的持续时间。它实际上会将视频扩展一点（然后在灰色方块中淡入淡出）。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [446.11566162109375, 129.87686157226562], "pos": [1425.2618408203125, -240.70643615722656], "id": 197, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [209, 212], "label": "INT", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "整数"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [161, "fixed"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "数值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveInt", "title": "Length", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [261.068603515625, 92.48806762695312], "pos": [1510.4599609375, -370.6125183105469], "id": 131, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.38", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveInt"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["[Tutorial](https://docs.comfy.org/tutorials/video/wan/vace) | [教程](https://docs.comfy.org/zh-CN/tutorials/video/wan/vace)\n\n[Causvid Lora extracted  by Kijai](https://www.reddit.com/r/StableDiffusion/comments/1knuafk/causvid_lora_massive_speedup_for_wan21_made_by/) Thanks to CausVid MIT\n\n##  14B 支持 480P 720P\n\n**Diffusion Model**\n- [wan2.1_vace_14B_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/wan2.1_vace_14B_fp16.safetensors)\n\n**LoRA**\n- [Wan21_CausVid_14B_T2V_lora_rank32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/blob/main/Wan21_CausVid_14B_T2V_lora_rank32.safetensors)\n\n仅供参考：在测试工作流程时，使用RTX 4090以720P分辨率以每秒81帧的速度运行完成大约需要40分钟。  \n使用Wan21_CausVid_14B_T2V_raro_rank32.safetensors后，可能只需要大约4分钟。\n\n## 1.3B 只支持 480P\n\n**Diffusion Model**\n- [wan2.1_vace_1.3B_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/wan2.1_vace_1.3B_fp16.safetensors)\n\n**LoRA**\n- [Wan21_CausVid_bidirect2_T2V_1_3B_lora_rank32.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/blob/main/Wan21_CausVid_bidirect2_T2V_1_3B_lora_rank32.safetensors)\n\n仅供参考：使用Wan21_CausVid_bidirect2_T2V_1_3B_lora_rank32.safetensors后，可能只需要大约2分钟。\n## 其他模型\n\n* 如果您以前使用Wan工作流，则可能已经有了这些模型。\n\n**VAE**\n- [wan_2.1_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors?download=true)\n\n**Text encoders**   Chose one of following model\n- [umt5_xxl_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp16.safetensors?download=true)\n- [umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors?download=true)\n\n> 您可以在fp16或fp8之间进行选择；我使用fp16来匹配Kijai的包装器。\n\n文件保存路径\n\n```\nComfyUI/\n├── models/\n│   ├── diffusion_models/\n│   │   ├-── wan2.1_vace_14B_fp16.safetensors\n│   │   └─── wan2.1_vace_1.3B_fp16.safetensors \n│   ├── text_encoders/\n│   │   └─── umt5_xxl_fp8_e4m3fn_scaled.safetensors # or fp16\n│   ├── loras/\n│   │   ├── Wan21_CausVid_14B_T2V_lora_rank32.safetensors\n│   │   └── Wan21_CausVid_bidirect2_T2V_1_3B_lora_rank32.safetensors\n│   └── vae/\n│       └──  wan_2.1_vae.safetensors\n```\n  \n## 关于CausVid Lora\n我们默认添加了CausVid LoRA以实现加速。然而，在某些情况下，视频可能会抖动并变得模糊。您可能需要测试不同的LoRA强度以获得最佳结果，该强度应在0.3到0.7之间。如果您不需要它，可以使用旁路模式禁用它，然后将“KSampler”的设置还原为默认设置。\n##关于模型选择\n14B模型的生成质量更好，但生成时间更长。如果您已经下载了模型，您可以选择直接使用上面的节点，或者只修改加载器节点加载的模型。\n相应的LoRA应与扩散模型相匹配。例如，对应于14B扩散模型的LoRA是14B LoRA。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [482.9140319824219, 891.4037475585938], "pos": [-518.4027709960938, 581.38330078125], "id": 183, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order":